              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichakaia isangenyi ijo jerekailoghe ni weke ndee, ijo neremnekieghe mdumiki wapo Jakobo. Wichakaia aho, na wana wawo, na weke wawae kwa kala na kala, na mdumiki wapo Daudi uchakaia m'baa wawo kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichabonya ilaghano ja sere nawo, najo jichakaia ilaghano ja kala na kala. Nichawimangisha na kuwibonya wichurikie; na Andu Kwapo kwa Wueli nichakuwika aghadi kwawo kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichakaia aghadi kwawo, nani nichakaia Mlungu wawo, nawo wichakaia wandu wapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
